## 2️⃣ Community-maintained UI wrappers (if you need a different look)

| Library | Framework | Highlights |
|---------|-----------|------------|
| **`mapbox-gl-geocoder` + Tailwind** | Any (just CSS) | Replace the default CSS with Tailwind utilities for a custom look. |
| **`mapbox-gl-geocoder` + Bootstrap** | Any | Use the built-in `geocoder` class together with Bootstrap’s form styles. |
| **`mapbox-gl-geocoder` + Material-UI** | React | Wrap the control in a `<Box>` and style with MUI’s theme. |
| **`mapbox-gl-geocoder` + Svelte** | Svelte | Use the `onMount` lifecycle to instantiate the control. |
| **`mapbox-gl-geocoder` + Alpine.js** | Alpine | Simple `x-data` to toggle visibility, etc. |

All of these are just **CSS overrides**; the underlying control stays the same, so you still get the same API and events.

